WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Choose Remove Background, import an image and select the processing method for your artwork. Then start.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Drag the comparison divider to see the original and the processed result together. Check that the subject is complete.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Switch between Original, Compare and Result to inspect the edges. Save a transparent image when ready, or continue to the next step.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.000
For a sharper image, choose Enhance and select the enlargement factor you need.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:07.000
After four-times enlargement, this image measures 4380 by 5600 pixels. Zoom in to inspect text and lines, and check the details you want to keep.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:17.000
When editing with instructions, describe the change you want and the artwork and text that should stay.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:26.970
For example, change the car body to blue. Compare the result with the original, then save it.
